              "es": "==Todavía no== sé surfear bien.",
              "en": "I don't know how to surf well yet."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Aún no== salen los jitomates en el huerto.",
              "en": "The tomatoes haven't come up in the garden yet."
            },
            {
              "es": "Son las doce y ==todavía== estás en pijama.",
              "en": "It's twelve and you're still in your pajamas."
            },
            {
